# CK3's live Struggle.GetLatestCatalystHistory datamodel can be invalidated when
# the running game appends another catalyst. The engine then refreshes a stale
# history row and dereferences a null entry (RVA 0x0F13076, read from 0x14).
#
# GUI types keep their first registered definition. Register this deliberately
# empty replacement before cooltip.gui so every struggle tooltip retains its
# phase, progress, effects and decisions without constructing the unsafe live
# catalyst-history list. This also prevents the phase-specific
# GetCatalystHistoryForPhase block override from finding a live item container.
types StruggleTooltipTypes
{
	type struggle_catalyst_history = vbox {
		visible = no
	}
}
